289
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:17,220
Wow, Nami, that warthog bought
that hook, line, and sinker.

290
00:14:17,560 --> 00:14:20,257
Be awfully snooty so
nami was a guy all along

291
00:14:20,340 --> 00:14:23,817
no wonder she acts so
manly i swear she treats me

292
00:14:23,900 --> 00:14:26,737
like some sort of beast
hey nami he got up to us

293
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:29,702
all right then lola this
is your chance to attack

294
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,777
i'll never see him again
and that's perfectly fine

295
00:14:32,860 --> 00:14:35,137
with me there's nothing
stopping you you'll make a

296
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:40,237
beautiful couple i'll give
it my best thank you for

297
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:43,520
everything nami you gave
me the courage to Fight!

298
00:14:48,980 --> 00:14:49,810
Excellent!

299
00:14:50,300 --> 00:14:51,580
I'm coming for you!

300
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:56,954
All right, you two, this is our chance!

301
00:14:57,180 --> 00:14:59,680
A non-violent solution, for us at least.

302
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:01,740
Wow, Nami, that was awesome!

303
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:03,877
She's not such a bad girl.

304
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:05,657
You just have to get to know her a bit.

305
00:15:05,740 --> 00:15:06,577
I know what you're thinking.

306
00:15:06,660 --> 00:15:08,240
I can see it in your eyes!

307
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:14,137
What kind of stupid
pirate ship doesn't have

308
00:15:14,220 --> 00:15:16,917
any treasure they have
a few chests and such.

309
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:21,397
But all of them are empty we did pick up
some money they had lying around at least.

310
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,757
What a waste of time
i have to look at your

311
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,737
uncute faces and there's
not even treasure.

312
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:27,817
I thought this was the
guy who beat crocodile

313
