you'd think he'd have a
bit more to show for it.

314
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:35,277
Whatever they've got plenty of food
let's take that back with us at least.

315
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,190
Aye-aye!

316
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,560
Mistress Perona!

317
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,320
Hm? Golden?

318
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:43,657
The Master is calling for a
meeting with the Mysterious Three.

319
00:15:43,740 --> 00:15:44,858
What is that about?

320
00:15:45,100 --> 00:15:46,337
Did something bad happen?

321
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:49,317
It would appear that Straw Hat
Luffy has just been captured.

322
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:51,576
This will be the debut of number 900.

323
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:53,080
Number 900?

324
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:54,300
For real?

325
00:15:56,820 --> 00:15:57,900
Master Ab!

326
00:15:58,380 --> 00:16:01,321
Get out here and marry me
right now, you big jerk!

327
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:04,636
You turned invisible and
ditched me again, didn't you?

328
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,200
This is strange.

329
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:12,581
There shouldn't be any
place left for them to run.

330
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,180
Hey, Kumasi!

331
00:16:18,620 --> 00:16:22,340
Absalom, I mean, Master
Absalom, this is bad.

332
00:16:22,620 --> 00:16:24,237
It seems intruders have...

333
