They just disappeared.

336
00:16:30,300 --> 00:16:33,320
Well, actually, that's the thing. Absalom!

337
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,220
What do you want?

338
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:37,714
I told you I don't like you in my room.

339
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:38,910
Perona.

340
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:41,140
Welcome back, Mistress Perona.

341
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,190
Is there anything...

342
00:16:42,273 --> 00:16:43,517
Yeah, I need you to stop talking!

343
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,117
How many times do I have to tell you that?

344
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:47,737
All right, but just this
once, there's something...

345
00:16:47,820 --> 00:16:48,650
Can it!

346
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:49,770
Nobody cares!

347
00:16:50,020 --> 00:16:52,657
Don't you think you're being
a bit too strict with Kumasi?

348
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,500
Or rather, way too strict?

349
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:55,780
He's my underling.

350
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:56,880
What's it to you?

351
00:16:57,860 --> 00:16:59,057
Anyway, did you hear?

352
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:00,611
Master is calling for us.

353
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:03,160
Did something happen?

354
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:05,026
I suppose you could say that.

355
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:07,620
Number 900 is making its big debut.

356
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:09,250
Number 900?

357
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:11,677
And he must have found a powerful shadow.

358
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:12,590
I wonder who...

359
00:17:12,673 --> 00:17:14,117
It's a miracle!

360
