What were you thinking hiding in here?

362
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,209
We were better off before!

363
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:21,697
What do you want from me?

364
00:17:21,780 --> 00:17:23,437
You were freaking out about that invisible

365
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:25,737
