366
00:17:25,820 --> 00:17:28,377
How was I supposed to
know it was a zombie, huh?

367
00:17:28,460 --> 00:17:31,401
We'll run away as soon as
we get the chance, okay?

368
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:32,520
Master Absalom!

369
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:34,597
That's where you're hiding.

370
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,877
There's something important
I needed to tell you.

371
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:37,790
Yes?

372
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:41,857
In addition to the pirates, I'm afraid
that we have another unwanted guest.

373
00:17:41,940 --> 00:17:42,770
Go on, then.

374
00:17:43,620 --> 00:17:45,780
It's him, the humming swordsman.

375
00:17:46,300 --> 00:17:47,180
He's back?

376
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:56,460
Did someone just fall from the sky?

377
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:59,569
Hey, is that what I
think it is down there?

378
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,280
It can't be.

379
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:06,715
Actually, looking at the shape, I
don't think it could be anything else.

380
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,830
Huh?

381
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:17,830
No!

382
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:20,760
Hey, hey!

383
00:18:21,260 --> 00:18:22,620
Ha, ha, ha, ha!

384
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:27,357
You think I'm gonna let you get away just
because you broke some measly bridge?

385
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,520
I'm a spider.

386
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:30,657
I can climb wherever the hell I want.

387
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:32,420
Monkey, monkey!

388
00:18:33,020 --> 00:18:35,717
You think you can keep
the spider busy for a sec?

389
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:36,630
What for?

390
00:18:36,980 --> 00:18:37,810
Perfect.

391
00:18:37,893 --> 00:18:40,097
There's an open section right over there.

392
00:18:40,180 --> 00:18:42,768
Anyway, I'm going to
build a spider smasher.

393
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:47,380
Sticky spider net!

394
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,820
He has a spinneret on his hand.

395
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,860
Time for Zeus fleurs.

396
00:18:57,020 --> 00:18:57,850
Slap.

397
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:02,457
You slap my eye you awful woman?

398
00:19:02,540 --> 00:19:03,477
No no!

399
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:04,390
Damn it!

400
00:19:04,473 --> 00:19:05,597
You're playing dirty!

401
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:06,740
This isn't fair!

402
00:19:08,100 --> 00:19:09,477
Good work, partner!

403
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:10,817
I'm ready to rock!

404
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:12,057
Step aside!

405
00:19:12,140 --> 00:19:13,657
My what's that?

406
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:18,917
This here I just stuck my steel nunchucks
into some stone columns! That's all!

407
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:23,577
Because when a monster is
this big, you gotta smash him!

408
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:24,660
Extra high!

409
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:28,200
Heavy induction!

410
00:19:33,760 --> 00:19:36,380
Where did all that power come from?

411
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:38,700
There's no way this guy is human!

412
00:19:48,980 --> 00:19:51,220
I said stop it already! Hey!

413
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:54,760
Sticky spider-nets!

414
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:02,240
Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!

415
00:20:02,380 --> 00:20:05,160
Looks like it's time for ribbons! Nuffins!

416
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:15,950
Hmph.

417
00:20:19,140 --> 00:20:20,220
Nico Robin!

418
00:20:20,500 --> 00:20:22,324
What the hell are those things?

419
00:20:22,660 --> 00:20:24,580
Mousey, mousey, mouse, mouse!

420
00:20:24,820 --> 00:20:26,560
Mousey, mousey, mouse, mouse!

421
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:29,320
I was careless. I'm sorry.

422
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:32,167
I didn't think there'd
be other spiders here.

423
00:20:39,900 --> 00:20:41,180
Damn it!

424
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:50,000
Serves you right, Tramonkey, Tramonkey!

425
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:54,460
That's what happens when
you let your guard down.

426
00:20:54,860 --> 00:20:56,389
These guys are my minions.

427
00:20:56,660 --> 00:20:58,217
They're called spider mice.

428
00:20:58,300 --> 00:21:01,359
There's more than 500 of
them here on Thriller Bark.

429
00:21:02,180 --> 00:21:05,100
Once we set our eyes on
you, there's no escape.

430
00:21:05,380 --> 00:21:07,968
We've never once failed
to capture our prey.

431
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:13,640
From the shadows, from your blind spot,
from where you least expect it, we attack.

432
00:21:14,200 --> 00:21:15,620
And thanks to Dr.

433
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:19,157
Hunkback's modifications, our
silk webs are unbreakable.

434
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:21,475
We picked off your friends one by one,

435
00:21:21,560 --> 00:21:23,677
silently carrying them
through the ceiling of the

436
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:26,257
mansion without anyone
noticing a single thing.

437
00:21:26,340 --> 00:21:27,797
Don't worry about your friends.

438
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:30,557
As soon as we carry you
off, you'll all be reunited.

439
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:32,052
Hope you enjoy the ride.

440
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:42,950
Stop it!

441
00:21:43,033 --> 00:21:44,920
Who the hell is singing that?

442
00:21:49,040 --> 00:21:51,917
Gather up all of the crew!

443
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:54,957
It's time to ship out Binx's brew.

444
00:21:55,040 --> 00:21:57,377
Sea wind blows to where?

445
00:21:57,460 --> 00:22:00,857
Who knows the waves will be our guide?

446
00:22:00,940 --> 00:22:04,297
Or across the ocean's tide?

447
00:22:04,380 --> 00:22:07,417
Rays of sunshine far and wide.

448
00:22:07,500 --> 00:22:10,457
Birds they sing of cheerful things.

449
00:22:10,540 --> 00:22:13,037
In circles passing by.

450
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:19,540
My goodness, it looks like you
came to this island after all?

451
00:22:20,120 --> 00:22:22,237
How did you get all the way up here?

452
00:22:22,320 --> 00:22:23,717
I jumped, of course.

453
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:25,057
I'm quite light.

454
00:22:25,140 --> 00:22:28,717
Since you're here already, I suppose
there's no point in holding back.

455
00:22:28,800 --> 00:22:31,817
Here, I'll tell you everything
I know about this island.

456
00:22:31,900 --> 00:22:33,540
Who are you, huh?

457
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:37,580
You're not a zombie Does that
mean you're with these pirates?

458
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:39,957
Hold on, what are you?

459
00:22:40,040 --> 00:22:43,317
Worry not, my friend,
I'm not going anywhere.

460
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:46,340
I'll put an end to this promptly!

461
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:52,120
Three verse humming

462
00:22:54,480 --> 00:22:56,000
Arrow not slash

463
00:23:10,040 --> 00:23:10,870
Thank you.
